The zero adds nothing, but the later 99 adds to the existing 20. Normal completion supplies 119 to the waiting Finished construction. resume and discard consume the same clause capability. One continues the waiting work; the other abandons it. Neither is an ordinary stored function.

Discard does not supply the clause’s result
In 04-discard-result.ash, the clause stops the continuation and returns only the value of discard:
